# The DuckDB the snapshot is written with, pinned on both sides. The desk pins
# @duckdb/node-api exactly in packages/data/package.json (and its lockfile);
# an app reads only a snapshot whose manifest names its own engine. The publish
# job refuses a desk commit whose pin differs from NODE_API here, and a
# snapshot whose manifest engine differs from ENGINE. Bump both with the desk.
NODE_API=2.0.0-r.1
ENGINE=v2.0.0
